          <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff;">🤖 Autonomous AI Sourcing Advisor</h3>
          <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--primary-accent);">Groq Llama-3.3-70b • Sub-Second Engineering Engine</span>
        </div>
        <div id="btnCloseSizing" class="close-btn" style="cursor: pointer;">&times;</div>
      </div>

      <div class="modal-body">
        <div style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
              <label for="intakeMode">Calculation Basis:</label>
              <select id="intakeMode" class="form-control">
                <option value="bill" selected>Monthly Electric Bill ($ USD)</option>
                <option value="kwh">Daily Consumption (kWh / day)</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
              <label id="intakeValueLabel" for="intakeValue">Monthly Electric Bill ($ USD):</label>
              <input type="number" id="intakeValue" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. 400" value="400">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            <label>Do you need help choosing an inverter, or matching the system to an inverter you already own?</label>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0.4rem;">
              <label for="inverterHelpYes" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; margin: 0;">
                <input type="radio" id="inverterHelpYes" name="inverterHelp" value="yes" style="width: auto; margin: 0;">
                Yes — I need inverter help
              </label>
              <label for="inverterHelpNo" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; margin: 0;">
                <input type="radio" id="inverterHelpNo" name="inverterHelp" value="no" checked style="width: auto; margin: 0;">
                No — battery bank only
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group" id="inverterDetailWrap" style="display: none; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            <label for="inverterDetail">Inverter details <span style="font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted);">(optional — leave blank and the advisor will ask you what it needs)</span></label>
            <textarea id="inverterDetail" class="form-control" rows="3" placeholder="e.g. I already own a Victron Quattro 48/10000, or: I have no inverter yet, off-grid cabin, 240V split-phase, want ~8kW continuous"></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            <label for="destRegion">Destination Region:</label>
            <select id="destRegion" class="form-control">
              <option value="Global DDP Port" selected>Global DDP Port (DDP Ocean Freight)</option>
              <option value="US West Coast">US West Coast / Mainland DDP</option>
              <option value="Hawaii Island">Hawaii (Honolulu / Hilo / Kawaihae DDP)</option>
              <option value="Europe / UK">Europe / UK Sea Freight</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div id="btnIntakeCalculate" class="btn btn-primary btn-full" style="cursor: pointer;">⚡ Calculate Teardown Specs</div>
        </div>

        <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-card); margin: 1.5rem 0;">

        <div class="chat-box" id="chatWindow">
          <div class="chat-msg bot">
            ⚡ <strong>BigEnergyCo Senior Sourcing Advisor</strong>:<br>
            Aloha! I am your autonomous off-grid energy &amp; direct-factory battery advisor powered by Groq Llama-3.3-70b. Ask me anything about EVE MB31 LFP cells, Sodium-Ion performance in cold climates, 16S4P/16S7P string setups, JK BMS integration, DDP ocean freight, or just say hi!
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="chat-input-row">
          <input type="text" id="chatInput" class="form-control" placeholder="Ask about cell specs, Sodium-Ion vs LFP, freight costs...">
          <div id="btnSendChat" class="btn btn-primary" style="cursor: pointer;">Send</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Lead Capture Modal -->
  <div id="leadModal" class="modal-overlay">
    <div class="modal-card" style="max-width: 520px;">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff;">📞 Request Senior Engineer Follow-Up</h3>
          <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--primary-accent);">Direct consultation & custom procurement quote</span>
        </div>
